  "content": "<blockquote>\n<div>\n<p>NotiFine 是一個基於 Fabric 的 OptiFine 替代模組包。目標是比 OptiFine 更快更新，讓您能以最佳效能和圖形設定享受 Minecraft 的最新功能！&nbsp;</p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsimplegamehosting.com%252f%253futm_source%253dmodrinth%2526utm_medium%253dbanner%2526utm_campaign%253dnotifine_modrinth%2526utm_id%253dnotifine\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vj13gnX.jpg\" alt=\"SimpleGameHosting 的橫幅 - 啟動 Minecraft 伺服器最簡單的方式\"> </a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fthebreakdown.xyz%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheBreakdown</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsimplegamehosting.com%252f%253futm_source%253dcurseforge%2526utm_medium%253dlink%2526utm_campaign%253dnotifine_curseforge%2526utm_id%253dnotifine\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleGameHosting</a> 團隊為您呈現</strong></p>\n</div>\n</blockquote><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>功能特點</strong></h2><blockquote>\n<div>\n<p>🟢 <strong>致力於在新版本上盡快達到 OptiFine 的同等功能。</strong></p>\n<p>🟢 <strong>可與大多數其他 Fabric 模組相容。（可依需求擴充模組包！）</strong></p>\n<p>🟢 <strong>包含生活品質功能，例如縮放和披風！</strong></p>\n<p>🟢 <strong>保持「原版」風格，讓您能夠無障礙加入原版和插件型伺服器。</strong></p>\n<p>🟢 <strong>伺服器端無需任何修改。</strong></p>\n</div>\n</blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p>",
